<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka avg annual inflation in April 16.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka avg annual inflation in April 16.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's April inflation, based on a 12-month moving average, fell to 16.4 percent from 16.7 percent in March, the Census and Statistics Department said on Wednesday.</p>
